---
description: Apply when changing HADES reasoning profiles, chat orchestration, Work Runtime, agent routing, context management or autonomous tools
alwaysApply: false
---
- Preserve the HADES pipeline: understand -> retrieve -> plan when needed -> execute/tools -> verify -> answer -> optional memory/knowledge update.
- Adaptive routing must be bounded and observable through useful metadata, not hidden chain-of-thought.
- Prefer structured model outputs for plans/tool choices/verification; validate them before execution.
- Tool selection must use only currently eligible tools and must feed failed/blocked results back to the model as failures.
- Do not mark tasks completed unless acceptance criteria/verification pass.
- Keep retries bounded and avoid infinite self-reflection loops.
- Context management should retrieve/summarize relevant content instead of sending whole histories or the whole repository.
